{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your journey as a <strong>simple Viking warrior</strong>, living in a small village in the harsh North. Ahead of you lie <strong>numerous challenges and events</strong> that may elevate you to the heights of glory. By surviving <strong>feuds</strong>, <strong>raids on Frisia and England</strong>, you can lead your clan and become a powerful <strong>Jarl</strong> or even a <strong>Konung</strong>. But the <strong>choice is yours</strong> \u2014 will you pursue conquest or turn away from the path of destruction to protect peaceful lands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with a variety of stories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic battles</strong>, where you can achieve warrior\u2019s glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romantic moments</strong>, bringing warmth to your heart amidst the wars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras/5905f085d67413e3e212319721d9b5d6.avif?t=1771321414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras_big/5905f085d67413e3e212319721d9b5d6.avif?t=1771321414 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose one of three paths and shape your destiny</strong>, unlocking one of <strong>16 unique endings</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking-Conqueror</strong>: Become a fearsome but just ruler, aiming to live and thrive alongside conquered lands rather than plundering them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking-Raider</strong>: Follow the path of looting and domination, with a single goal \u2014 to conquer everything and everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defender</strong>: Turn away from destruction and join the Anglo-Saxon kingdoms, protecting them from invaders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision you make determines not only your destiny but also the future of kingdoms, nations, and the entire era. Which path will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras/7168300cb99b8e99888419edeadcd217.avif?t=1771321414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras_big/7168300cb99b8e99888419edeadcd217.avif?t=1771321414 width=800 height=238 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game by the Numbers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ story-driven backgrounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ equippable items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>190+ character illustrations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70+ engaging quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 possible endings</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Three Types of Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-view battles</strong>, where you can showcase your warrior skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical assaults and sieges</strong>, to demonstrate your commanding abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic battles</strong>, where you can unleash your inner tactician.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plus one mini-game.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras/50983503ef26cf7cb02fce9189b04443.avif?t=1771321414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras_big/50983503ef26cf7cb02fce9189b04443.avif?t=1771321414 width=800 height=230 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Foundation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in <strong>849 AD</strong> and covers the events of the first campaign of the <strong>&quot;Great Heathen Army&quot;</strong> in <strong>850 AD</strong> to <strong>Kent</strong> and <strong>Mercia</strong>, where you can rewrite the outcome of this invasion and the fate of England itself.<br><strong>Can you build upon this success and achieve what the Duke of Normandy accomplished two centuries later, uniting England under a single ruler?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story explores significant events of the time, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invasion of <strong>Rorik of Jutland</strong> in <strong>Dorestad</strong> and <strong>Utrecht</strong> (850 AD, modern Netherlands).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invasion of <strong>Kent and Mercia (~850 AD)</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The capture of <strong>York</strong> in <strong>867 AD</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many other historical events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, we\u2019ve aimed to treat history with the utmost respect, recreating:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The daily life of Vikings</strong>, their training, and their equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The unique features of Anglo-Saxon kingdoms</strong>, including the titles of thanes, historical rulers, and much more.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996650?t=1771321414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/0163f5ce82202d1805e5cf5c0c960f4c091f7543/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771321414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/ae52009ad3cecbe132f8833a904304fc9276d52e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771321414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/ae52009ad3cecbe132f8833a904304fc9276d52e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771321414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or unappropriate for viewing at work (partial nudity, sexual themes)"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your journey as a <strong>simple Viking warrior</strong>, living in a small village in the harsh North. Ahead of you lie <strong>numerous challenges and events</strong> that may elevate you to the heights of glory. By surviving <strong>feuds</strong>, <strong>raids on Frisia and England</strong>, you can lead your clan and become a powerful <strong>Jarl</strong> or even a <strong>Konung</strong>. But the <strong>choice is yours</strong> \u2014 will you pursue conquest or turn away from the path of destruction to protect peaceful lands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with a variety of stories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic battles</strong>, where you can achieve warrior\u2019s glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romantic moments</strong>, bringing warmth to your heart amidst the wars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras/5905f085d67413e3e212319721d9b5d6.avif?t=1771321414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras_big/5905f085d67413e3e212319721d9b5d6.avif?t=1771321414 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose one of three paths and shape your destiny</strong>, unlocking one of <strong>16 unique endings</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking-Conqueror</strong>: Become a fearsome but just ruler, aiming to live and thrive alongside conquered lands rather than plundering them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking-Raider</strong>: Follow the path of looting and domination, with a single goal \u2014 to conquer everything and everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defender</strong>: Turn away from destruction and join the Anglo-Saxon kingdoms, protecting them from invaders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision you make determines not only your destiny but also the future of kingdoms, nations, and the entire era. Which path will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras/7168300cb99b8e99888419edeadcd217.avif?t=1771321414\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996650/extras_big/7168300cb99b8e99888419edeadcd217.avif?t=1771321414 width=800 height=238 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game by the Numbers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ story-driven backgrounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ equippable items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>190+ character illustrations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70+ engaging quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 possible endings</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Three Types of Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragra